<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $0.50 lower. Demand moderate on a light to moderate movement. Top $60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			   Country				 Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 LBS. 58.00-59.00, Few 57.50 &amp; 59.50  58.50-60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 LBS. 52.50-57.50			   Few 60.50</p>
<p>	  210-230 LBS. 48.00-52.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Weak to 1.00 Lower. Top 49.00</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 LBS.  42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 LBS.  45.00-48.00</p>
<p>Few over 600 LBS.  48.00-49.00</p>
